# Code and comments in English

- Write all **source code** (identifiers, string literals in code) in English.
- Write all **comments** and **docstrings** in English.
- Keep user-facing messages (logs, errors, CLI) in English unless the product explicitly targets another language.

Apply this in every file you create or edit.
